WEBVTT

00:45.040 --> 00:47.310
Eykha, that's enough!

00:57.490 --> 00:59.250
Eykha!!

01:03.220 --> 01:08.000
<i>The heat-haze shimmers, ember-toned</i>

01:08.000 --> 01:12.430
<i>Its blurred afterimage far away</i>

01:12.430 --> 01:14.560
<i>(I'm back in this life)</i>

01:25.350 --> 01:34.690
<i>My shout added to the noise</i> <i>and disappeared into the chaos</i>

01:34.690 --> 01:35.690
<i>(Don't wait)</i>

01:35.690 --> 01:37.790
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

01:37.790 --> 01:40.860
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

01:40.860 --> 01:43.100
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

01:43.100 --> 01:45.300
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

01:45.300 --> 01:49.540
<i>Defiling even this chosen fate</i>

01:49.540 --> 01:55.780
<i>With the blood of judgment</i>

01:55.780 --> 02:01.280
<i>"If I can just solve this unraveling</i> <i>moment with my own hands"</i>

02:01.280 --> 02:06.350
<i>I howled enough to burn my life out</i>

02:06.350 --> 02:12.030
<i>I left my hopes to an</i> <i>undependable past and vanished</i>

02:12.030 --> 02:17.630
<i>Cruelly enough, my voice was beautiful</i>

02:17.630 --> 02:21.670
<i>The ending world</i>

02:21.670 --> 02:26.540
<i>I'll be a judgment light</i>

02:33.520 --> 02:35.920
Sorry I'm late!

02:38.190 --> 02:42.160
Red Dragon can be defeated with this, right?

02:42.160 --> 02:44.490
The dragon's claw...

02:44.490 --> 02:47.230
Can we really count on this?

02:47.230 --> 02:49.330
What do you mean?

02:49.330 --> 02:53.270
The dragon will continue to revive so long as Inori is around.

02:53.270 --> 02:58.170
So even if we defeat the dragon with this, there's no meaning to it.

02:58.170 --> 02:59.370
Maybe...

02:59.370 --> 03:02.840
...it's the key to restoring Red Dragon's sanity?

03:02.840 --> 03:09.950
If so, the person to wield this should be someone related to Red Dragon, not me.

03:09.950 --> 03:16.520
But Ulrika sacrificed her life to entrust the dragon's claw to you...

03:16.520 --> 03:18.720
She's no longer with us...

03:21.760 --> 03:25.570
There's only one person to whom the dragon's claw should be entrusted.

03:25.570 --> 03:27.700
Now, Lou! The dragon!

03:27.700 --> 03:32.640
Let me savor the supreme life ruling this world!

03:32.640 --> 03:34.740
Why, of course, my lord!

03:34.740 --> 03:39.040
All our travels have led up to this very moment!

03:49.320 --> 03:51.260
Th-This is...?!

03:54.460 --> 03:57.830
The State Magic Territory has shifted to that of Kouran!

03:57.830 --> 04:00.740
Even Red Dragon will lose its power!

04:00.740 --> 04:02.760
One! Two!

04:08.310 --> 04:10.680
This... This is it, Lou!

04:10.680 --> 04:12.910
Indeed, my lord...

04:13.980 --> 04:16.080
I'll kill you...!

04:16.080 --> 04:21.080
All you outsiders tainted Nil Kamui!

04:28.300 --> 04:32.270
"Kouran residential district"

04:32.270 --> 04:33.870
What business do you have here,
Black Dragon Knight?!

04:33.870 --> 04:37.270
Um, well, I came to...

04:37.270 --> 04:40.840
Hold your fire, and open the way!

04:40.840 --> 04:43.610
What's the matter, Sweallow?

04:43.610 --> 04:48.280
Can the rumored Qilin Chuán be mobilized now, Byakuei?

04:48.280 --> 04:49.780
Where did you hear of that?!

04:49.780 --> 04:52.620
It can't be deployed so easily!

04:52.620 --> 04:55.820
Ka Grava and I came up with a plan.

04:55.820 --> 04:57.310
A plan?

04:59.160 --> 05:04.130
Either you choose to listen, or I make you listen by force...

05:04.130 --> 05:06.900
Which do you prefer?

05:06.900 --> 05:08.390
Let me hear it.

05:09.740 --> 05:11.310
Seventy-one!

05:11.310 --> 05:13.040
Seventy-two!

05:15.580 --> 05:17.310
You're wonderful, Lou!

05:17.310 --> 05:20.040
You're the greatest user there is!

05:21.050 --> 05:23.080
My lord...!

05:30.730 --> 05:32.220
Eykha...

05:38.930 --> 05:40.340
Lou?!

05:40.340 --> 05:42.670
Are you all right?!

05:42.670 --> 05:45.340
I'm going to kill Red Dragon.

05:45.340 --> 05:47.710
I won't let anyone get in my way!

05:57.020 --> 06:00.620
So, it seems Lou changed the Magic Territory...

06:00.620 --> 06:03.220
That's why I wanted to borrow the Qilin Chuán.

06:03.220 --> 06:08.530
With the Magic Territory shifted to Kouran, we can now face Red Dragon.

06:10.130 --> 06:15.600
We know this is an absurd request, but please...!

06:15.600 --> 06:21.630
Líng Mŭ has ordered that the Qilin Chuán be used for Kouran's escape.

06:24.550 --> 06:32.120
But I can't abandon the citizens, even if they are from another country...

06:32.120 --> 06:33.390
Then...!

06:33.390 --> 06:35.760
I, the Leader of Ten Thousand, Byakuei...

06:35.760 --> 06:37.920
...will disobey my country's orders for the first time.

06:42.160 --> 06:47.570
In the name of the heavenly lord,
I request the dispatch of the Qilin Chuán!

06:47.570 --> 06:50.470
Jíjí rú lŭ lìng!

07:16.530 --> 07:22.040
Hmm... Is Byakuei planning to ram
Red Dragon with the Qilin Chuán?

07:22.040 --> 07:23.440
Could it be...?

07:23.440 --> 07:25.030
Ka Grava?

07:28.280 --> 07:31.450
He must have a plan...

07:31.450 --> 07:32.940
Eykha...

07:34.280 --> 07:35.840
Where are you...?

07:46.190 --> 07:50.230
Red Dragon, hear my words as the Child of Contract!

07:50.230 --> 07:52.460
Child of Contract...

07:55.140 --> 07:59.210
The despair your sibling bears is darker than dark itself,

07:59.210 --> 08:02.540
and her flames of wrath are burning strong...

08:02.540 --> 08:07.740
Even my consciousness is about to be swallowed by her anger...

08:13.390 --> 08:15.490
That's...?!

08:15.490 --> 08:16.920
Ibuki...!

08:16.920 --> 08:18.650
The dragon's claw...!

08:23.900 --> 08:26.030
You're the one who should be using it!

08:26.030 --> 08:28.500
I'm counting on you!

08:28.500 --> 08:31.510
Will he understand the meaning of that claw?

08:31.510 --> 08:34.210
All we can do now...

08:34.210 --> 08:36.110
...is believe in him.

08:39.110 --> 08:45.090
But even if Red Dragon regains its sanity, in order to truly defeat Inori...

08:45.090 --> 08:47.050
He has his equivalent exchanges.

08:47.050 --> 08:49.960
There's Ka Grava, Lou, and me.

08:49.960 --> 08:54.700
There are many on this battlefield whom he holds precious.

08:54.700 --> 08:56.690
What in the world are you saying...?

09:05.110 --> 09:08.240
Please protect yourself with the Black Curtain!

09:08.240 --> 09:10.880
I can only use that barrier once a day...

09:10.880 --> 09:12.550
I'll save it till the very last!

09:12.550 --> 09:15.780
Of all the times to be stingy!

09:15.780 --> 09:17.270
Unbelievable!

09:18.550 --> 09:23.930
Ibuki, I know you're going to struggle now and in the future...

09:23.930 --> 09:27.230
Let me help you just a bit more...

09:27.230 --> 09:29.090
We are friends, after all...

09:30.630 --> 09:31.730
Val...?!

09:31.730 --> 09:33.770
Eykha!

09:33.770 --> 09:35.940
Eykha...!

09:35.940 --> 09:38.610
Please, answer me...!

09:38.610 --> 09:40.100
Eykha!

09:42.510 --> 09:46.580
My travels began when I met Eykha...

09:46.580 --> 09:48.780
You're not my sword...

09:48.780 --> 09:50.820
You're precious to me.

09:50.820 --> 09:55.120
So, I won't let you die, Eykha...!

09:59.630 --> 10:02.660
I-Ibuki...

10:02.660 --> 10:04.150
Eykha!

10:06.130 --> 10:11.210
My life is about to end...

10:11.210 --> 10:14.800
So, I want to use it for you, Ibuki...

10:16.340 --> 10:19.480
I won't let you become a victim of all this!

10:19.480 --> 10:20.780
Wait for me here...

10:20.780 --> 10:22.440
Ibuki...

10:24.490 --> 10:26.150
Red Dragon...

10:26.150 --> 10:27.640
I•••

10:30.860 --> 10:34.630
"Qilin Chuán \ The 'Qilin Chuán' is Kouran's

10:30.860 --> 10:34.630
final weapon brought in to defend Nil Kamui.

10:30.860 --> 10:34.630
Throughout the vessel are firearms powerful

10:30.860 --> 10:34.630
enough to wholly annihilate a castle, all of

10:30.860 --> 10:34.630
which are controlled by Byakuei's mind,

10:30.860 --> 10:34.630
truly affording him the power of ten thousand."

10:39.200 --> 10:42.070
Hello there, dear brother...

10:42.070 --> 10:45.040
I'm sorry I couldn't protect you...

10:45.040 --> 10:47.880
But let's stop all this already...

10:47.880 --> 10:50.240
This isn't the kind of thing a king does.

10:50.240 --> 10:55.150
A king is allowed to do such things, dear brother...

10:55.150 --> 10:56.640
Inori!

10:57.720 --> 10:59.890
If you die and become a Returned One,

10:59.890 --> 11:04.030
you'll go back to being the kind, dear brother I used to like...

11:04.030 --> 11:07.160
That's right! Why didn't
I figure that out before?!

11:07.160 --> 11:09.490
Isn't that right, my Red Dragon?

11:16.940 --> 11:18.700
Incinerate him!

11:22.940 --> 11:24.710
Ka Grava...!

11:27.280 --> 11:29.910
I'm pretty sturdy, you know?

11:34.420 --> 11:35.860
I can't control it!

11:35.860 --> 11:38.190
Wh-What are you doing, Sweallow?!

11:38.190 --> 11:41.430
Whatever I use breaks.

11:41.430 --> 11:45.270
But at the moment it does,
I can draw out all of its power!

11:45.270 --> 11:47.440
That goes for warships, too.

11:47.440 --> 11:52.370
M-My clan spent 100 years building this ship!

11:52.370 --> 11:54.210
If it breaks, make it again!

11:54.210 --> 11:55.380
Wha--?!

11:55.380 --> 11:58.750
New things are only born from destruction!

11:58.750 --> 12:02.220
You're planning to expend it just for that one moment?!

12:02.220 --> 12:05.880
That's the sin we humans carry...

12:07.220 --> 12:08.790
I see...

12:08.790 --> 12:11.920
So that's what my curse is about...

12:14.960 --> 12:16.960
Damn it!

12:16.960 --> 12:18.570
I'm going to punch you later!

12:18.570 --> 12:19.900
Be ready!

12:19.900 --> 12:22.170
Byakuei...!

12:22.170 --> 12:28.180
I believe we need to survive in order for you to be properly punched, Sir Sweallow.

12:28.180 --> 12:29.910
Meryl...

12:40.790 --> 12:43.660
Before the Black Dragon Knight gets in our way,

12:43.660 --> 12:47.830
let me drink Red Dragon's life dry, Lou.

12:47.830 --> 12:50.330
No, my lord...

12:50.330 --> 12:52.600
Sweallow...!

12:54.300 --> 12:55.800
Wait, Lou!

12:55.800 --> 12:58.140
Now is the time to kill Red Dragon!

12:58.140 --> 13:01.440
Now is the time to defeat <i>him</i>!

13:03.180 --> 13:04.210
Lou?!

13:04.210 --> 13:05.780
What is she up to?!

13:05.780 --> 13:07.270
At this rate...!

13:16.490 --> 13:18.060
Hey there, Lou.

13:18.060 --> 13:19.530
--What?!
--Huh?!

13:19.530 --> 13:22.200
I thought you were going to defeat Red Dragon.

13:22.200 --> 13:25.000
First, I'm going to kill you.

13:25.000 --> 13:30.870
My life's purpose would be denied if I let you be!

13:30.870 --> 13:32.810
Well, that's quite an honor.

13:32.810 --> 13:35.000
But you're a bit too late.

13:37.010 --> 13:39.250
Sweallow...!

13:39.250 --> 13:41.150
Contract seal, release!

13:41.150 --> 13:43.310
Eat this!

14:00.570 --> 14:02.370
Sir Sweallow...!

14:04.610 --> 14:06.670
Sweallow...!

14:06.670 --> 14:09.280
--Lou!
--Out of my way!

14:09.280 --> 14:13.580
Black Dragon! I call upon the Black Curtain!

14:24.860 --> 14:28.760
Sir Sweallow...!

14:47.950 --> 14:49.650
Now then...

14:49.650 --> 14:52.720
It's my turn, Ibuki.

14:52.720 --> 14:55.590
So you were planning this all along...?!

14:55.590 --> 14:59.490
Your words should reach Red Dragon now.

15:03.930 --> 15:05.760
What are you saying?

15:07.430 --> 15:10.340
Red Dragon is immortal!

15:17.510 --> 15:19.750
Val! Eykha!

15:19.750 --> 15:21.240
Why...?!

15:22.350 --> 15:27.320
I want to be your sword until the very end...

15:27.320 --> 15:29.920
No! That won't do!

15:32.960 --> 15:35.690
Wait... Maybe...

15:46.710 --> 15:49.440
Answer my voice, Red Dragon!

15:49.440 --> 15:53.040
Recover your soul as Nil Kamui's guardian!

16:00.220 --> 16:03.690
So, you brought me back from my state of madness...

16:03.690 --> 16:05.790
You have my gratitude.

16:05.790 --> 16:09.230
You truly are the king of Nil Kamui.

16:11.670 --> 16:13.960
What is your desire?

16:16.070 --> 16:20.470
I traveled long and far so that
I could return to you this curse.

16:20.470 --> 16:22.240
Curse...?

16:22.240 --> 16:26.380
You wish to return to me the power granted by our contract?

16:26.380 --> 16:30.650
No... Right now, I need this power.

16:30.650 --> 16:35.020
That's why I'll live with this curse.

16:35.020 --> 16:38.430
But I want to sever this sad chain of events...

16:38.430 --> 16:43.330
If so, offer me an equivalence...

16:43.330 --> 16:45.230
My equivalence...

16:49.040 --> 16:51.440
I understand...

16:51.440 --> 16:56.410
I will offer you the life of the one most precious to me...

16:56.410 --> 16:59.900
But I want you to promise me one thing.

17:03.250 --> 17:06.290
How dare that monster...?!

17:06.290 --> 17:09.450
Red Dragon, burn them to ashes!

17:11.390 --> 17:12.880
What's the matter?!

17:17.360 --> 17:19.070
Throughout our travels,

17:19.070 --> 17:26.270
Lou, Ka Grava, Sweallow, and Eykha have sacrificed many precious things...

17:28.910 --> 17:32.550
Losing things made us move forward.

17:32.550 --> 17:35.750
But I didn't want to lose anything...

17:35.750 --> 17:41.090
I tried not to take anyone's life or lose anything precious...

17:41.090 --> 17:47.320
But that only meant I continued to live while taking something precious from someone else.

17:49.130 --> 17:50.800
I decided...

17:50.800 --> 17:54.830
...which friend to kill, and in turn, what was to be protected.

17:57.810 --> 18:01.180
Now do it, Ibuki!

18:01.180 --> 18:04.630
I will offer Eykha's life to Red Dragon!

18:07.350 --> 18:08.850
Ibuki!

18:08.850 --> 18:11.090
Eykha...

18:11.090 --> 18:13.090
I understand...

18:13.090 --> 18:15.580
S-Stop, dear brother!

18:17.090 --> 18:20.290
Red Dragon! Destroy them!

18:27.470 --> 18:30.140
Listen to me, Eykha...

18:30.140 --> 18:32.940
I'm going to do something horrible to you...

18:32.940 --> 18:35.440
You probably won't forgive me for this...

18:35.440 --> 18:37.000
Ibuki...

18:40.550 --> 18:44.280
Even so, I will protect you...

18:55.900 --> 18:58.030
Inori, I promise you...!

18:58.030 --> 18:59.670
No...

18:59.670 --> 19:02.840
I won't repeat the sorrow you went through!

19:02.840 --> 19:06.010
--No...
--I'll make a country without sorrow!

19:06.010 --> 19:07.340
Dear brother...

19:07.340 --> 19:08.830
Please, no...!

19:18.690 --> 19:21.480
Good night, Inori...

19:23.860 --> 19:25.920
Dear... brother...

19:31.600 --> 19:34.170
Not a bad ending at all...

19:34.170 --> 19:38.070
I will reward you for your work.

19:38.070 --> 19:42.680
Uh, if you mean lifting my curse, don't worry about it.

19:42.680 --> 19:43.940
Oh?

19:43.940 --> 19:49.420
This "curse" of creating and breaking is something we humans bear.

19:49.420 --> 19:53.680
I want to see what the future holds for this curse.

19:58.560 --> 20:00.360
Sir Sweallow...!

20:02.360 --> 20:08.790
Well, it looks like Black Dragon still wants me to live...

20:12.210 --> 20:14.770
You... lowlife...!

20:15.780 --> 20:17.380
Ouch...!

20:17.380 --> 20:20.380
Lowlife! Lowlife! Lowlife!

20:20.380 --> 20:21.870
Oww!

20:44.740 --> 20:47.840
Looks like we can have fun again, Lou...

20:47.840 --> 20:50.000
Yes, my lord...

20:55.450 --> 20:59.410
"One month later... \ Shuka Government"

20:59.920 --> 21:04.460
Our spiritual mother has approved of Nil Kamui's new system.

21:04.460 --> 21:08.200
We were finally able to receive approval from our country as well.

21:08.200 --> 21:10.530
Now we can focus on the restoration.

21:10.530 --> 21:17.340
Then, is it final that both D'natia and Kouran officially approve of the new king?

21:17.340 --> 21:20.270
There are no objections from the council.

21:20.270 --> 21:24.950
Now then, let us bring in the new king-to-be.

21:21.140 --> 21:41.460
<i>I was gazing at the faint, dissolving rainbow</i>

21:24.950 --> 21:27.810
Uh, I'm sorry...

21:27.810 --> 21:31.620
Ibuki asked that we delay the crowning ceremony.

21:39.860 --> 21:45.470
I will offer you the life of the one most precious to me... Eykha.

21:41.460 --> 21:51.710
<i>All alone</i>

21:45.470 --> 21:47.900
But I want you to promise me one thing.

21:47.900 --> 21:52.840
I want you to give a part of
Val's remaining life to Eykha.

21:52.840 --> 21:54.010
Can you do that?

21:54.010 --> 21:55.810
Yes.

21:55.810 --> 22:02.380
But that would mean that two lives would come together as one anew.

22:02.380 --> 22:11.930
Even if she gains a new life, her soul, memory, and mind will not be the same as before.

22:03.380 --> 22:08.720
<i>It started talking as though in a whisper</i>

22:08.720 --> 22:14.060
<i>Now that the wind has stopped howling</i>

22:11.930 --> 22:14.330
Are you all right with that?

22:14.060 --> 22:20.070
<i>What is it you're thinking?</i>

22:14.330 --> 22:17.930
Both Eykha and Val have little time to live.

22:17.930 --> 22:21.370
I'm going to protect Eykha...

22:20.070 --> 22:28.340
<i>O light snatched away as pain</i>

22:21.370 --> 22:23.770
...by offering her as a sacrifice.

22:23.770 --> 22:28.080
Even if Eykha becomes someone completely different from the Eykha I know...

22:28.080 --> 22:30.210
...I want her to live!

22:29.740 --> 22:40.190
<i>Fly away: in exchange for memories of sadness</i>

22:35.950 --> 22:39.120
Last of the Dragon Shrine Maidens...

22:39.120 --> 22:44.560
I have given you a new body and soul...

22:40.190 --> 22:56.070
<i>Say goodbye: I won't forget the tears that flow</i>

22:46.760 --> 22:48.960
I•••

22:48.960 --> 22:52.630
...feel like I need to see someone...

22:52.630 --> 22:55.300
If so, then go...

22:56.070 --> 23:02.940
<i>Say goodbye</i>

23:03.140 --> 23:04.810
I'll•••

23:13.890 --> 23:17.380
...travel with you again...

23:20.960 --> 23:21.430
"Act 12"

23:22.400 --> 23:25.490
"Act 12 \ One Chance in a Million"
